    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Utility Billing Historys-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Utility Billing History Retrieval API allows users to access detailed billing history records for utility services. This endpoint is designed for utility providers and customer service applications seeking to present historical billing data to customers or internal systems. By retrieving this information, users can better understand consumption patterns, track payments, and resolve billing inquiries efficiently. Typical consumers include utility companies, customer support teams, and financial analysts who need reliable access to historical billing data.",
